  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 15 January 2019). Our client Debashish Mehra is a 71-year-old chartered accountant who lives at Bungalow 21, Edappally, Kochi 682003 and can be reached on +91 83945 29272 or debashish.mehra@example.com. The client's PAN LCFPM4750L.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Coastal Textiles Pvt Ltd. A cheque for Rs 23,70,000 issued by Coastal Textiles Pvt Ltd bounced: the cheque was dishonoured because the signature did not match.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 952691284249 (IFSC KKBK0752414).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 1968/2019 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Kochi on 5 May 2019.",
